e><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Tanaka</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Sekiguchi</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Retrospective clinical study on the notable efficacy and related factors of infliximab therapy in a rheumatoid arthritis management group in Japan (RECONFIRM)</article-title><source>Mod Rheumatol</source><year>2007</year><volume>17</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>178</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s10165-007-0562-2</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Yamanaka H, Tanaka Y, Sekiguchi N, et al. Retrospective clinical study on the notable efficacy and related factors of infliximab therapy in a rheumatoid arthritis management group in Japan (RECONFIRM). Mod Rheumatol. 2007;17(2):178. </citation></ref><ref id="CR15"><label>15.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gerrit</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Marijin</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Willem</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Development of antiinfliximab antibodies and relationship to clinical response in patients with rheumatoid arithritis</article-title><source>Arthritis Rheum</source><year>2006</year><volume>54</volume><fpage>711</fpage><lpage>5</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/art.21671</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Gerrit JW, Marijin V, Willem L, et al. Development of antiinfliximab antibodies and relationship to clinical response in patients with rheumatoid arithritis. Arthritis Rheum. 2006;54:711&#x02013;5. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16508927</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR16"><label>16.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bijl</surname><given-names>AE</given-names></name><name><surname>Breedveld</s